{"id":"5917cc9ed72aafa4","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FmPRow.md","title":"FmPRow","display":"FmPRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FmPRow","parameters":["z125","z126","z127"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FmPRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z125</span><span>z126</span><span>z127</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>z125</code>、<code>z126</code>、<code>z127</code>。</p>\n<p>有限带标签公式。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FmPRow z125 z126 z127)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z127 t)\n    (or\n      (exists z130 (and (@ Nat z130) (@ PAtom z130 t)))\n      (or\n        (exists z131\n          (exists z132\n            (and\n              (@ PImp z131 z132 t)\n              (and\n                (exists z133 (exists z134 (and (in z133 z126) (and (@ App z125 z133 z134) (= z134 z131)))))\n                (exists z135 (exists z136 (and (in z135 z126) (and (@ App z125 z135 z136) (= z136 z132)))))))))\n        (or\n          (exists z137\n            (exists z138\n              (and\n                (@ PAnd z137 z138 t)\n                (and\n                  (exists z139 (exists z140 (and (in z139 z126) (and (@ App z125 z139 z140) (= z140 z137)))))\n                  (exists z141 (exists z142 (and (in z141 z126) (and (@ App z125 z141 z142) (= z142 z138)))))))))\n          (exists z143\n            (exists z144\n              (and\n                (@ POr z143 z144 t)\n                (and\n                  (exists z145 (exists z146 (and (in z145 z126) (and (@ App z125 z145 z146) (= z146 z143)))))\n                  (exists z147 (exists z148 (and (in z147 z126) (and (@ App z125 z147 z148) (= z148 z144))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" href=\"?note=635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" title=\"ZFC_PAnd\">PAnd</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"892530c42a605aab\" href=\"?note=892530c42a605aab\" title=\"ZFC_POr\">POr</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FmPRow z125 z126 z127)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAnd|PAnd]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_POr|POr]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolve